        "why_justification": "The five counts, the shortfall total and the cost of bottles sold total are the review's headline figures; each is recomputable from the findings and the FIFO costing the policy defines. Entailed by: \"A JSON object with exactly these keys and nothing else\"",
        "tag": "core"
      },
